Yes — that S3 detail is important because it changes how I would frame the backlog.

The project is not “build a generic sync client for every provider.” It is more specifically:

> **Add local desktop-style synchronization for matters whose storage provider is S3, because OneDrive and other supported providers already have their own sync capability.**

So I would split the work into epics and tickets like this.

