# Epic 10 — Server Change Notifications

S3 alone does not give the desktop client the same sort of sync semantics that OneDrive provides, so this needs deliberate implementation.

- **Define backend change-event model**
  - FileCreated
  - FileUpdated
  - FileDeleted
  - FileRenamed
  - FolderCreated
  - FolderDeleted

- **Create server-to-bot notification mechanism**
  - SignalR/WebSocket or suitable existing messaging mechanism.

- **Add polling fallback**
  - Useful after connection loss or missed messages.

- **Add change cursor/checkpoint**
  - Bot should know the last server change it processed.

- **Reconcile after reconnect**
  - Retrieve changes since last known cursor/version.

This is one of the tickets I would consider mandatory rather than optional.

